  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MADA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Palestinian Center for Development and Media Freedoms - MADA - MADA submitted a proposal aimed at strengthening the capacity ofyoung Palestinians to advocate for freedom of expression. The initiative will equip youth with skills in media production,storytelling, and legal frameworks to address issues such as press freedom, digital rights, and media censorship through podcasting and radio.
The project will establish a youth-led media platform to amplify voices on freedom of expression in Palestine.It will produce and broadcast podcasts, engage community radio stations, and foster public dialogue with policymakers, journalists, and civil society actors to influence media policy and promote democratic participation.
Project location, Bethlehem and Jerusalem</narrative>
  </description>
